        "identifier": "urn:wmo:md:io-wis2dev-metdx-demo:metoffice.global.forecast.edr",
        "title": "Met Office Global Model forecast via OGC EDR (ICE demo, Met Office Labs)",
        "description": "Forecast data from the Met Office Global numerical weather prediction model, served by the Met Office Labs ICE demonstrator through the OGC Environmental Data Retrieval (EDR) API. Two collections are available: data on pressure levels (air temperature, relative humidity, wind speed and direction, geopotential height) and station/screen-level data (mean sea level pressure, screen temperature and dew point, visibility, fog fraction, surface temperature, 10 m wind and gust, relative humidity). Each model run is published as an EDR instance and can be queried by position, area and other EDR query types, returning CoverageJSON. An interactive web client is also available. This is an experimental demonstration service.",
